Subject: CPMS I03A Activation Candidate Data Design

@ [design_uuid] 9cc6feb9-3a16-4899-baa7-0541e421746d

& [ManifestDelta] has exact fields
  + workspace dependency name jsonschema version requirement =0.49.2 default_features false
  + tool dependency workspace true optional true
  + feature schema-conformance members json-schema and dep:jsonschema in lexical order

& [LockObservation] is evidence only
  + package name version source checksum dependencies and resolved feature set
  + selected family members jsonschema jsonschema-regex jsonschema-value referencing
  + added package custom-build proc-macro native-link license and advisory accounts
  + production lock digest is formed only after exact resolution

& [FocusedTestIdentity] is cpms_i03a_schema_validator_dependency
  + feature gate requires schema-conformance
  + no ignored test and no environment opt-in
  + all test resources are compile-time constants or checked-in I02 canonical artifacts

& [DocumentExpectation] binds root kind path bytes sha256 document_id dialect direction root reference count definition count and I02 bundle digest
  + prepare_input 17034 bytes SHA256 8B39562FE221282A7539A54D84C4708843259C49FD510C9FBD24A566B9780CD5
  + run_input 47360 bytes SHA256 69767C7A3553A1B977D48844CF6609DD919246F5D8B95F358B59AE87C5E78415
  + verify_input 51176 bytes SHA256 D6C3E26779DDBC7FB0CD5B341DD02F62F58E19D042A87C22645FE681E5013691
  + base_response 53014 bytes SHA256 40FD8536021892ADB35CECBCA717AD2CA68FA5125A3C027FC8274364FCE1B77C
  + preparation_response 53021 bytes SHA256 9D51B85036B9A4FF7C519693F60C6ECF99C7CC5E529EF7DB423365D776C7B51A
  + bundle 247809 bytes SHA256 03616F46C4A3C4B7FA4B9D0A668E16FF4B47BA71CB70879B10F1D95157ADCB42

& [ProbeCase] is private test data
  + case_id root applicability exact JSON bytes expected meta compile and instance disposition rule identity and optional numeric relation
  + case ordering is lexical by case_id
  + cases cannot call Cantor semantic admission provider model service or effect behavior

& [ReferenceDenialCase] covers HTTP HTTPS file relative UNC drive-letter unknown scheme unresolved fragment and escaping dynamic reference
  + expected identity is denial class and no constructed validator rather than library display string

& [NumericCase] retains exact token expected mathematical relation and expected schema disposition
  + u64 maximum and maximum plus one are mandatory
  + no f64 conversion is used as the test oracle

& [DeterminismObservation] is first and replay equality over stable booleans counts normalized rule identities and digests
  + diagnostic message text and iteration order are excluded unless normalized explicitly

& [ResourceAccount] has checked documents schema_bytes definitions references schema_depth instances instance_bytes instance_depth findings and diagnostic_characters
  + exceeding any limit refuses the focused probe without partial pass

& [NoPersistentArtifact] test output remains assertion state only
  + no generated JSON lock report cache database log or signature is written by test code

& [DesignDisposition] is exact_test_only_candidate_data_no_production_form
